    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="13.08.001"></a>Division 13-08-001<br />Stormwater Management</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1308001.html#13.08.001.0001">13-08-001-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Stormwater Management</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.08.001.0001"><a name="13.08.001.0001">13-08-001-0001</a> Stormwater Management</h3>
            <p class="P0">The design and construction of all public and private stormwater management facilities shall be in accordance with these regulations and with the City of Flagstaff Stormwater Management Design Manual and these standards. In the event of a conflict, the more stringent regulation shall apply. (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017)</p>

    </div>
